<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Confirmation de commande · {{ shop.name }}</title>
  <!--[if mso]>
  <style type="text/css">
    body, table, td { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif !important; }
  </style>
  <![endif]-->
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #FAF6F1; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1A1410; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">

  <!-- Preheader (caché mais visible en preview inbox) -->
  <div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all;">
    Votre commande {{ order.name }} est confirmée. Merci de votre confiance.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #FAF6F1;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 16px;">

        <!-- Container 600px -->
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="max-width: 600px; width: 100%; background-color: #FFFFFF;">

          <!-- HEADER -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 32px 24px 32px; background-color: #FAF6F1;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #1A1410; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1;">
                AURÉLIA
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase;">
                Paris &middot; Skincare
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- BANDEAU CRÈME -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 32px 8px 32px; background-color: #F5EDE4;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.3; color: #1A1410; font-weight: 400;">
                Votre commande est confirmée
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #6B2336; text-transform: uppercase;">
                Commande {{ order.name }}
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="height: 32px; background-color: #F5EDE4; line-height: 32px; font-size: 1px;">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>

          <!-- SALUTATION + MESSAGE -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 40px 16px 40px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                Bonjour {{ customer.first_name | default: 'chère cliente' }},
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                C'est avec joie que nous accueillons votre commande dans nos ateliers parisiens. Chaque pièce Aurélia est inspectée à la main avant son envoi &mdash; un soin que nous ne déléguons à personne.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                Vous recevrez un nouvel email dès l'expédition, avec le numéro de suivi.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- RÉCAPITULATIF -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 24px 40px 8px 40px;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9A96E; padding-bottom: 12px;">
                Votre commande
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- LINE ITEMS -->
          {% for line_item in order.line_items %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 20px 40px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                <tr>
                  <td width="80" valign="top" style="padding-right: 16px;">
                    {% if line_item.image %}
                      <img src="{{ line_item | img_url: '160x' }}" alt="{{ line_item.title | escape }}" width="80" style="display: block; width: 80px; height: auto; border: 1px solid #F5EDE4;">
                    {% else %}
                      <div style="width: 80px; height: 80px; background-color: #F5EDE4;">&nbsp;</div>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1A1410;">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1A1410; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                      {{ line_item.title }}
                    </div>
                    {% if line_item.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
                    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B6B6B; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                      {{ line_item.variant.title }}
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B6B6B;">
                      Quantité : {{ line_item.quantity }}
                    </div>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top" align="right" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1A1410; white-space: nowrap;">
                    {{ line_item.line_price | money }}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}

          <!-- TOTAUX -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 8px 40px 32px 40px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-top: 1px solid #F5EDE4;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 16px 0 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #6B6B6B;">Sous-total</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding: 16px 0 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1A1410;">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% if shipping_price > 0 %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #6B6B6B;">Livraison</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1A1410;">{{ shipping_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% else %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #6B6B6B;">Livraison</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #C9A96E; font-style: italic;">Offerte</td>
                </tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if tax_price > 0 %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #6B6B6B;">TVA</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1A1410;">{{ tax_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endif %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 16px 0 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #1A1410; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #1A1410;">Total</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding: 16px 0 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #1A1410; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #1A1410;">{{ total_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ADRESSE LIVRAISON -->
          {% if order.shipping_address %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 40px 32px 40px;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #C9A96E; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9A96E; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                Adresse de livraison
              </div>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1410;">
                {{ order.shipping_address.name }}<br>
                {{ order.shipping_address.address1 }}<br>
                {% if order.shipping_address.address2 != blank %}{{ order.shipping_address.address2 }}<br>{% endif %}
                {{ order.shipping_address.zip }} {{ order.shipping_address.city }}<br>
                {{ order.shipping_address.country }}
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endif %}

          <!-- CTA -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 16px 40px 48px 40px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="background-color: #1A1410;">
                    <a href="{{ order.order_status_url }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 16px 40px; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #FAF6F1; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500;">
                      Suivre ma commande
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- NOTE QUESTIONS -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 40px 40px 40px; background-color: #FFFFFF;">
              <div style="background-color: #FAF6F1; padding: 24px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1A1410;">
                  Une question ? Répondez simplement à cet email &mdash;<br>nous lisons chaque message personnellement.
                </p>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- FOOTER -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 32px; background-color: #1A1410;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #FAF6F1; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                AURÉLIA
              </div>
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #C9A96E; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase;">
                L'équipe Aurélia &middot; Paris
              </div>
              <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <a href="https://instagram.com/aureliaparis" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #FAF6F1; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 12px;">Instagram</a>
                <span style="color: #C9A96E;">&middot;</span>
                <a href="https://tiktok.com/@aureliaparis" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #FAF6F1; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 12px;">TikTok</a>
              </div>
              <div style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.7; color: #8A8580;">
                AURÉLIA Paris &middot; 12 rue de Sévigné, 75004 Paris<br>
                <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color: #8A8580; text-decoration: underline;">{{ shop.url | remove: 'https://' | remove: 'http://' }}</a>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
